          "title": "巣鴨拘置所 — Wikipedia in giapponese",
          "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B7%A3%E9%B4%A8%E6%8B%98%E7%BD%AE%E6%89%80",
          "kind": "enciclopedia"
